# Deploy to GitHub Pages

How this game reaches `{{ pages_url }}`. It is a project Pages site: `pages.yml` builds
it with `BASE_PATH={{ base_path }}`, read from the repository name, and uploads the
`build/` directory. The page covers the one-time setup of the Pages source and the
package read grant, what a push to `main` triggers, how to confirm a deployment, and how
to roll one back.
